      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전에는 녹청파와 함께\n도와주셔서 감사했어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804C5D0B2940020B179CCADD30CC6400020D568AED8000AB3C4C640C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD588C5B4C694002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그때 함께 지내기로 한 팬텀 말인데요,\n요즘 통 보이질 않는 거 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B54C0020D568AED80020C9C0B0B4AE30B85C0020D55C0020D32CD1400020B9D0C778B370C694002C000AC694C9980020D1B50020BCF4C774C9C80020C54AB2940020AC700020C788C8E0002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 야생 포켓몬이니까\n다른 곳으로 갔어도 이상하진 않지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC774B2C8AE4C000AB2E4B9780020ACF3C73CB85C0020AC14C5B4B3C40020C774C0C1D558C9C40020C54AC9C0B9CCC694002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 매일 보던 녀석이 안 보이니\n허전하기도 하고, 걱정되기도 해요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020B9E4C77C0020BCF4B3580020B140C11DC7740020C5480020BCF4C774B2C8000AD5C8C804D558AE30B3C40020D558ACE0002C0020AC71C815B418AE30B3C40020D574C694002E002E002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 이상한 부탁이긴 하지만,\n팬텀을 찾는 걸 도와주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020C774C0C1D55C0020BD80D0C1C774AE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C000AD32CD140C7440020CC3EB2940020AC780020B3C4C640C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고스트타입 포켓몬에 관한 거라면\n저스티스회의 무쿠 씨가 전문이에요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n같이 도장에 가 보죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020AD00D55C0020AC70B77CBA74000AC800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC7580020BB34CFE00020C528AC000020C804BB38C774C5D0C694002E00100001BE00000AAC19C7740020B3C4C7A5C5D00020AC000020BCF4C8E00021001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
