      "displayText": "샹델라가 감지한 것에 의하면\n찾고 있는 팬텀이 있는 곳은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n쉬르 리슈라는 것 같아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0F9B378B77CAC000020AC10C9C0D55C0020AC83C5D00020C758D558BA74000ACC3EACE00020C788B2940020D32CD140C7740020C788B2940020ACF3C74000100001BE00000AC26CB9740020B9ACC288B77CB2940020AC830020AC19C544002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
